evidence = "Commit bbfdff2207750090af2a44abb4413ac6c5bab020 changed only the launchpad logo from the shared blob 8214cb3aa160713875d4776eadf58f177465fb3b to the 38,350-byte vector at apps/launchpad/web/public/icons/logo.svg:1, while apps/perps/public/assets/logo.svg:7 retains the 1,626,439-byte raster-backed export exposed by apps/perps/src/assets/index.ts:40; commit f21aec13152e75c46ff95a73637627a7fbcd45c3 removed their byte-sync row using the incorrect artwork distinction and unchanged-logo commit 637c9c63da15d53eae493665591a26bcb2799d6c recorded at tests/ci/repair_22_39_152.kvx:353, so tests/ci/test_copied_artifacts_in_sync.py:214 no longer compares them and tests/ci/test_web_asset_weight.py:64 still permits the oversized copy."
